  <entry>
    <title>MIPS ?</title>
    <url>/czyyy_nlw/2026/10/20/MIPS/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h1 id="常用的一些宏"><a href="#常用的一些宏" class="headerlink" title="常用的一些宏"></a>常用的一些宏</h1><ol>
<li>输入 <figure class="highlight mipsasm"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">.macro</span> input(%in)</span><br><span class="line">    li $<span class="built_in">v0</span>, <span class="number">5</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">syscall</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword"></span>    <span class="keyword">move </span>%in, $<span class="built_in">v0</span></span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>输出<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro print(%out)</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 1</span><br><span class="line">    move $a0, %out</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>打印换行<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro println()</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 11</span><br><span class="line">    li $a0, 10</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>打印空格<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro printspace()</span><br><span class="line">    li $v0, 11</span><br><span class="line">    li $a0, 32</span><br><span class="line">    syscall</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>计算二维数组字节偏移量<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro calc_addr(%dst, %row, %col, %rank)</span><br><span class="line">    multu %row, %rank</span><br><span class="line">    mflo %dst</span><br><span class="line">    addu %dst, %dst %col</span><br><span class="line">    sll %dst, %dst, 2</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>读数组元素 arr[index] -&gt; %val (用到$t8 $t9)<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro lw_arr(%val, %base, %index)</span><br><span class="line">    sll $t8, %index, 2</span><br><span class="line">    add $t9, %base, $t8</span><br><span class="line">    lw %val, 0($t9)</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>写数组元素 %val -&gt; arr[index] (用到$t8 $t9) <figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">.macro sw_arr(%val, %base, %index)</span><br><span class="line">    sll $t8, %index, 2</span><br><span class="line">    add $t9, %base, $t8</span><br><span class="line">    sw %val, 0($t9)</span><br><span class="line">.end_macro</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<hr>
</li>
</ol>
<h1 id="循环的写法"><a href="#循环的写法" class="headerlink" title="循环的写法"></a>循环的写法</h1><ol>
<li>单循环 <figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># s0 = n </span><br><span class="line">li $t0, 0  # t0 = i = 0</span><br><span class="line">for_loop:</span><br><span class="line">    beq $t0, $s0, end_for</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">     # code</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    addi $t0, $t0, 1</span><br><span class="line">    j for_loop</span><br><span class="line">end_for:</span><br><span class="line">    # over</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>双循环<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># s0 = n</span><br><span class="line"># s1 = m</span><br><span class="line">li	$t0, 0	# t0 = i = 0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">loop_i:</span><br><span class="line"> beq	$t0, $s0, end_loop_i</span><br><span class="line"> li	$t1, 0					# t1 = j = 0</span><br><span class="line">loop_j:</span><br><span class="line"> beq	$t1, $s1, end_loop_j</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> # code</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> addi	$t1, $t1, 1				# j++</span><br><span class="line"> j	loop_j</span><br><span class="line">end_loop_j:</span><br><span class="line"> addi	$t0, $t0, 1				# i++</span><br><span class="line"> j	i</span><br><span class="line">end_loop_i:</span><br><span class="line"> # over</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ol>
